[{"client_msg_id":"5e3bf854-a386-416d-855f-704adbd0f170","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"おそらく、t 付きの feedkeys が処理された後、t のなんらかの状態が残っているのかなあと推測しています。（ぜんぜんわからない）","ts":"1634031172.109100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0hT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7e8cc2c1-c09b-4bd2-b237-3eaa77abffe8","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"bazが入ってくるのは変に思えるな","ts":"1634030206.108500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qeekt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a63f2564-3181-4c3e-a952-f94ffeb74954","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"lmapの解決をさせるのに使ったことがある","ts":"1634029759.108100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iIsp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"230f5c37-5b70-479c-9663-ab24543bf250","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`t` フラグ何もわからない…","ts":"1634029021.107600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oET"}]},{"client_msg_id":"df0ea6b3-aae7-4903-ac30-2a5ad7b5688a","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"feedkeys の `t` の挙動に違和感があるという内容で vim に issue 立てようかと思います。\nマクロに記録されるキーがおかしいのではないか？という内容になっています。\n``` set nocompatible\n\nfunction! Test() abort\n  call feedkeys(\"\\\u0026lt;Ignore\u0026gt;\", 'n')\n  call feedkeys(\"foo\", 'n')\n  call feedkeys(\"bar\", 'nt')\n  call feedkeys(\"baz\", 'n')\n  call feedkeys(\"foo\", 'n')\n  call feedkeys(\"bar\", 'nt')\n  call feedkeys(\"baz\", 'n')\nendfunction\nautocmd InsertEnter * ++once call Test()```\n1. こういうスクリプトを用意する\n2. このスクリプトをソースする\n3. qq でマクロの記録を開始してから insert-mode に入る（すると、バッファに foobarbazfoobarbaz が挿入される）\n4. insert-mode を抜けて、q でマクロの記録を終了する\n5. マクロを実行すると `barbaz` が挿入される\n`t` フラグが指定しているのは `bar` に対してだけなので、直感的には `barbar` になると思われるが、そうならない。\n\nという内容を予定しています。","ts":"1634026952.107300","thread_ts":"1634026952.107300","reply_count":9,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F5Kq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c670d300-cd8f-411e-9f4b-dffdf51e1248","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"それはそれとして、Vim に fuzz test 通すのいいと思う。どんどんやってほしい。","ts":"1633964591.104800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":1,"users":["UEACRCY0Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TME"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9c2b8792-6657-4fb6-bd3e-e159cd2529a6","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"意図を読むという意味ではよいでしょうけど、foo/bar/bazを再利用して誤解などがあってもつまらないので、1回目と2回目でfoo1/foo2とかにしたほうがいいかも?","ts":"1634031364.109200","thread_ts":"1634026952.107300","parent_user_id":"U8R597E9H","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nm7e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ef562c08-ed6b-4bf9-8ed4-21b6d2ac67e2","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"！！","ts":"1634033840.109400","thread_ts":"1634026952.107300","parent_user_id":"U8R597E9H","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=sys"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52e4b49e-2beb-4306-9f8e-dd4842eb7455","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"\u003c@UAZ33BKV2\u003e さんのアドバイスをもとに手元で追試してみましたところ","ts":"1634033852.109600","thread_ts":"1634026952.107300","parent_user_id":"U8R597E9H","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9K0yY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3cf345ca-025d-4663-a5b9-dcde54a52476","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"実は挿入されていたのは `bar2baz2` だということが発覚しました。","ts":"1634033876.109800","thread_ts":"1634026952.107300","parent_user_id":"U8R597E9H","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+vc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5127e607-5578-4513-8579-1e94f3cd033d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なんとw?","ts":"1634033887.110000","thread_ts":"1634026952.107300","parent_user_id":"U8R597E9H","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5xp9/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c604047-783e-42ae-a63d-5a0edaa722c4","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"問題の趣旨はかわらず「t フラグがおかしい」となりますが、「最後に指定された t フラグだけが有効になっている」と言えるかもしれませんｗ","ts":"1634033915.110200","thread_ts":"1634026952.107300","parent_user_id":"U8R597E9H","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Ut"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5cf591a-c215-4598-a511-e491e78a4e4c","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"1. キーを積み上げている最中の「最後の t」だけが有効となる\n2. 「最後の t」以降に積み上げたキーは全部 t の影響を受ける\n","ts":"1634033979.110400","thread_ts":"1634026952.107300","parent_user_id":"U8R597E9H","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fDE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd3422f5-0ff5-4511-b450-fab79541ecbd","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"こういうことのようですね。","ts":"1634033983.110600","thread_ts":"1634026952.107300","parent_user_id":"U8R597E9H","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kmVn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"841e6091-3578-40b0-9d1c-16d08a0474e1","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー、不具合でもあるけど一貫性もあるみたいな...","ts":"1634035305.110800","thread_ts":"1634026952.107300","parent_user_id":"U8R597E9H","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eExfH"}]}]
